---

Leylines is a school addon for [Iron’s Spells ’n Spellbooks](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks) on NeoForge 1.21.1.

Craft the **Leyline Codex** and **Ley Staff**, then start weaving Leyline spells into your kit. If you run [Spell Codex](/mods/spell-codex) and [Spell Actionbar](/mods/spell-actionbar), Leyline spells appear as another school tab to discover, unlock, and equip.

Without Codex, Leyline still registers as an Iron’s school — find its scrolls and spells the usual Iron’s way, or put them on the Actionbar.
